# TreeTagger Albanian tagset
#
# Albanian TreeTagger Part-of-Speech Tags. The coarse part-of-speech is encoded in
# the head of each tag (the part before the first '.') and follows the Universal POS
# categories (ADJ, ADP, ADV, AUX, CCONJ, DET, INTJ, NOUN, NUM, PART, PRON, PROPN,
# PUNCT, SCONJ, SYM, VERB); the remainder encodes morphological features. The
# portmanteau tag PART|PRON is mapped by its first component (POS_PART).
#
# Source: extracted from the TreeTagger model using TT4J
